WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.270
- The two lawyers who fire
bombed an NYP police car

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.050
in the BLM protests last year

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.280
have reached a deal with prosecutors.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.620
The two attorneys at issue,

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:09.900
one of whom was an associate

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.640
at a very fancy New York law firm,

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.990
have agreed to plead guilty to one count

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.840
of making or possessing
a destructive device.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.037
That carries a maximum
term of 10 years in prison,

00:00:19.037 --> 00:00:22.240
though they probably won't
receive anything like that.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.500
Though it is possible that the judge

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.660
might use a terrorism enhancement

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.930
when deciding on the sentence, but still,

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.860
they're not gonna get 10 years,
they'll get less than that

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.010
and they will probably be disbarred

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.870
for being convicted of this felony crime.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:35.703
So just goes to show you,

00:00:35.703 --> 00:00:37.890
you might agree with
someone's political stance,

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.230
but that doesn't give you the right

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.840
to use a Molotov cocktail

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.810
to try and get your desired result

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.953
or we'll see you in court.

